  "release": "R1",
  "outcome": "A legal sponsor's DAF program becomes Active only after an executed contract, recorded board delegation, an isolated tenant, a validated brand/terminology/policy configuration with the legal-sponsor disclosure, validated integrations and tied-out opening balances",
